## Status values

- NOT_STARTED - Planned, not implemented/executed.
- IN_PROGRESS - Active work or partly resolved decisions, with current evidence.
- BLOCKED - Named missing decision, dependency, access, device, or approval.
- DONE - Every scoped task and acceptance criterion met with evidence.

Dependencies are completion prerequisites. Unstarted dependent work is NOT_STARTED; a
concrete attempted-work blocker is BLOCKED and must name the owner/action. See
..\docs\TODO-CONVENTIONS.md for the full update and completion contract.

